\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Structural Fidelity for Learning Rate ($T$). Parity plot demonstrating robust linear recoverability ($r=0.753$, $R^2=0.566$) with superior fidelity compared to $L_0$. The consistently tight clustering around the diagonal across all $T$ values indicates the model encodes learning rate dynamics with high precision. \relax }}{16}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
